<title>USA: RPM Inc Q1 Aug 31 net grows.</title>
<headline>RPM Inc Q1 Aug 31 net grows.</headline>
<dateline>MEDINA, Ohio 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>In thousands, except per share data</p>
<p>				(Unaudited)</p>
<p>					  Three Months Ended August 31,</p>
<p>						    1996		 1995</p>
<p>								    Restated*</p>
<p> Net Sales				  $329,231	   $282,954</p>
<p> Cost of Sales			     186,535	    163,313</p>
<p> Gross Profit				142,696	    119,641</p>
<p>Selling, General &amp; Administrative</p>
<p>   Expenses				   93,406	     78,748</p>
<p> Interest Expense, Net		     7,628		6,147</p>
<p> Income Before Income Taxes	     41,662	     34,746</p>
<p> Provision for Income Taxes	     17,706	     14,753</p>
<p> Net Income				   23,956	     19,993</p>
<p>Earnings per Common Share</p>
<p>   &amp; Common Share Equivalent**	     .31		  .27</p>
<p>Earnings per Common Share</p>
<p>   Assuming Full Dilution**		  .29		  .25</p>
<p>* Data for August 31, 1995 has been restated to reflect a 25% stock dividend paid on December 8, 1995, and to reflect the January 12, 1996 acquisition of TCI, Inc, accounted for under the pooling-of-interests method.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk  (212) 859-1610</p>
